#: includes/admin-login.php:150
msgid "How people get in"
msgstr "Cómo entra la gente"

#: includes/admin-home.php:141 includes/admin-login.php:136
msgid "Sign-in page"
msgstr "Página de acceso"

#: includes/admin-home.php:145
msgid "Not chosen yet: wp-login.php is doing the job."
msgstr "Todavía sin elegir: lo está haciendo wp-login.php."

#: includes/admin-home.php:147
msgid "Choose it"
msgstr "Elegirla"

#: includes/admin-home.php:151
msgid "Link by email"
msgstr "Vinculación por correo"

#: includes/admin-home.php:154
msgid ""
"On. If the email does not exist, the account is created in the same step."
msgstr "Prendida. Si el correo no existe, la cuenta se crea en el mismo paso."

#: includes/admin-home.php:155
msgid ""
"On, for accounts that already exist. New ones are not created from here."
msgstr "Prendida, para cuentas que ya existen. Nuevas no se crean desde acá."

#: includes/admin-home.php:159
msgid "Only the email link: wp-login.php sends people to the sign-in page."
msgstr ""
"Sólo el enlace por correo: wp-login.php manda a la gente a la pantalla de "
"ingreso."

#: includes/admin-home.php:160
msgid "Only username and password, the WordPress one."
msgstr "Sólo usuario y contraseña, el de WordPress."

#: includes/admin-home.php:161
msgid "The email link and the password, both."
msgstr "El enlace por correo y la contraseña, las dos."

#: includes/admin-home.php:171
msgid "Off: nobody is asked for a second step."
msgstr "Apagada: no se le pide un segundo paso a nadie."

#: includes/admin-home.php:172
msgid "Optional: whoever wants it turns it on from their profile."
msgstr "Opcional: la prende desde su perfil quien quiera."

#: includes/admin-home.php:173
msgid "Required for everybody who can use it."
msgstr "Obligatoria para todo el que pueda usarla."

#: includes/admin-home.php:177 includes/admin-login.php:16
#: templates/account/security.php:73
msgid "Two-step verification"
msgstr "Verificación en dos pasos"

#: includes/admin-home.php:183 includes/admin-login.php:17
#: templates/account/security.php:176
msgid "Passkeys"
msgstr "Passkeys"

#: includes/admin-home.php:188
#, php-format
msgid "On, tied to %s."
msgstr "Prendidas, atadas a %s."

#: includes/admin-home.php:191
msgid "Off. It is the only way in that cannot be phished."
msgstr "Apagadas. Es la única forma de entrar que no se puede phishear."

#: includes/admin-home.php:195 includes/admin.php:24
#: includes/admin-social.php:77
msgid "Social login"
msgstr "Login social"

#: includes/admin-home.php:199
#, php-format
msgid "Working: %s"
msgstr "Funcionando: %s"

#: includes/admin-home.php:202
msgid ""
"There are providers with credentials, but none is verified and enabled yet."
msgstr ""
"Hay redes con credenciales, pero ninguna verificada y prendida todavía."

#: includes/admin-home.php:203
msgid "No provider set up yet: only the email link works."
msgstr "Ninguna red configurada: sólo funciona el enlace por correo."

#: includes/admin-home.php:206 includes/admin-social.php:43
msgid "Providers"
msgstr "Proveedores"

#: includes/admin-home.php:215
msgid "Outgoing email"
msgstr "Correo saliente"

#: includes/admin-home.php:218
msgid ""
"Something is hooked into delivery, but whether mail actually leaves cannot "
"be known from here. Send yourself a link to find out."
msgstr ""
"Hay algo enganchado al envío, pero si el correo sale de verdad no se puede "
"saber desde acá. Mandate un enlace para averiguarlo."

#: includes/admin-home.php:219
msgid ""
"Nothing is hooked into delivery: WordPress will try the server’s mail() and "
"that usually fails. Without email there is no sign-in link."
msgstr ""
"No hay nada enganchado al envío: WordPress va a probar con el mail() del "
"servidor y eso suele fallar. Sin correo no hay enlace de acceso."

#: includes/admin-home.php:223
msgid "Session length"
msgstr "Duración de la sesión"

#: includes/admin-home.php:227
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d days with “remember me”, %2$d without."
msgstr "%1$d días con «recordarme», %2$d sin."

#: includes/admin-home.php:232
msgid "Change it"
msgstr "Cambiarla"

#: includes/admin-home.php:238
msgid "What is asked of people"
msgstr "Qué se le pide a la gente"

#: includes/admin-home.php:240
msgid "Nothing beyond the email address."
msgstr "Nada más que el correo."

#: includes/admin-home.php:260
msgid "If you get locked out"
msgstr "Si te quedás afuera"

#: includes/admin-home.php:262
msgid ""
"On a site without passwords and without outgoing email, an expired session "
"leaves you outside. With access to the server:"
msgstr ""
"En un sitio sin contraseñas y sin correo saliente, una sesión vencida te "
"deja afuera. Con acceso al servidor:"

#: includes/auth.php:56 includes/admin-login.php:415
msgid "A code by email"
msgstr "Un código por correo"

#: includes/auth.php:57
msgid ""
"We send a six-digit code to the address on the account. Nothing to install."
msgstr ""
"Mandamos un código de seis dígitos a la dirección de la cuenta. No hay nada "
"que instalar."

#: includes/auth.php:65 includes/admin-login.php:416
msgid "An authenticator app"
msgstr "Una aplicación autenticadora"

#: includes/auth.php:66
msgid ""
"The six-digit code that changes every thirty seconds, from Google "
"Authenticator, 1Password, Aegis or whichever one you use."
msgstr ""
"El código de seis dígitos que cambia cada treinta segundos, de Google "
"Authenticator, 1Password, Aegis o la que uses."

#: includes/login.php:164
msgid "Someone"
msgstr "Alguien"

#: includes/login.php:173
#, php-format
msgid "Your sign-in link for %s"
msgstr "Tu enlace para entrar a %s"

#: includes/login.php:187
msgid ""
"Click here to sign in:\n"
"\n"
"{link}\n"
"\n"
"The link expires in {minutes} minutes and works once.\n"
"\n"
"If you did not ask for it, ignore this message: nobody can get into your "
"account without it."
msgstr ""
"Hacé clic acá para entrar:\n"
"\n"
"{link}\n"
"\n"
"El enlace vence en {minutes} minutos y sirve una sola vez.\n"
"\n"
"Si no lo pediste vos, ignorá este mensaje: nadie puede entrar a tu cuenta "
"sin él."

#: includes/sso.php:513
msgid ""
"The provider did not hand over an access token. Check the client ID and the "
"secret."
msgstr ""
"El proveedor no entregó un token de acceso. Revisá el ID de cliente y el "
"secreto."

#: includes/sso.php:524
msgid ""
"The token worked but the profile came back empty. The app is probably "
"missing the permissions this provider needs."
msgstr ""
"El token funcionó pero el perfil volvió vacío. Lo más probable es que a la "
"aplicación le falten los permisos que pide este proveedor."

#: includes/sso.php:604
msgid "It works"
msgstr "Funciona"

#: includes/sso.php:605
msgid "It did not work"
msgstr "No funcionó"

