#: includes/admin-sessions.php:51
msgid ""
"By default WordPress ends the session after 2 days, or 14 with “remember "
"me”. On a passwordless site that means going through the email again and "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Por defecto WordPress cierra la sesión a los 2 días, o a los 14 con "
"«recordarme». En un sitio sin contraseñas eso obliga a repetir el trámite "
"del correo todo el tiempo."

#: includes/admin-sessions.php:57
msgid "With “remember me”"
msgstr "Con «recordarme»"

#: includes/admin-sessions.php:60 includes/admin-sessions.php:68
msgid "days"
msgstr "días"

#: includes/admin-sessions.php:61
msgid ""
"The sign-in link always counts as “remember me”: there is no password to "
"type again."
msgstr ""
"El enlace de acceso cuenta siempre como «recordarme»: no hay contraseña que "
"volver a escribir."

#: includes/admin-sessions.php:65
msgid "Without “remember me”"
msgstr "Sin «recordarme»"

